<p class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Rentals</p>
<h1>50cc Motorbike Hanoi: Short Riders vs Automatic Scooter</h1>
<p>Most 50cc machines are automatic scooters, so the real question for a short rider in Hanoi is not transmission but size: a small, light 50cc scooter or a larger automatic scooter with a taller seat and more bulk. The 50cc rents at a verified 200,000 VND per day, our shop at 112 Nguyen Van Cu, Long Bien is open from 09:00 to 21:00 daily, and both categories are usually on the floor for you to sit on before deciding. This page compares them honestly for riders of shorter stature, from the flat-foot test to storage and price.</p>
<p>It belongs to the <a href="/hanoi-50cc-motorbike-rental/">50cc motorbike rental hub for Hanoi</a> and sits beside our other guides for short riders. For the full price table across every model we rent, see the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost overview</a>, and for rental terms, the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> answers what we hear at the counter every day.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<p>Table of contents</p>
